otation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"栗園在中道之西，西道之東。考異曰：清傳云：「與長孫翰出長川。」今從蠕蠕傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"栗园在中道之西，西道之东。考异曰：清传云：「与长孙翰出长川。」今从蠕蠕传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"a6fc7787-db0e-11ef-8625-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白","place_name_jianti_auto":"白","resolved_place_entity_id":2939,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a6fc7795-db0e-11ef-b50d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○和兜山，在漠南。后魏主焘始光三年，自云中西巡至五原，既...","context_before":"尔寒山[在府北塞外。","source_end_index":96,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e1c18d93-5739-5b71-a67d-7af3774b5ab1","source_start_index":10,"source_text":"后魏主焘始光二年，五道伐柔然，一军从东道出黑漠，一军出白黑二漠间，魏主从中道，一军出栗园，一军从西道出尔寒山。诸军至漠南。舍辎重，轻骑赍十五日粮，度漠击之，柔然惊走，即此。"},{"context_after":"白漠盖在黑漠西也。亦谓之大碛。四年，魏主西伐统万，命其将...","context_before":"...定襄郡武要县西北。晋义熙二年，魏主珪如豺山宫，遂至石漠。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"55ac6188-5dfd-5218-b5e7-b297a1511aee","source_start_index":90,"source_text":"又魏主焘始光二年，大伐柔然，遣长孙翰等从东道出黑漠，长孙道生等出白、黑二漠间。"},{"context_after":"栗园盖与长川相近]。","context_before":"...始七年，魏主建鹿野浮图于苑中之西山，是也。栗园，在塞北，","source_end_index":126,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"feb8a0c8-022d-5dae-a98d-797f4dfa2ebd","source_start_index":102,"source_text":"魏主焘始光二年，分道伐柔然，遣娥清出栗园，是也。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"14癸卯，魏主大伐柔然，五道並進：長孫翰等從東道，出黑漠，廷尉卿長孫道生等出白、黑二漠之間，魏主從中道，東平公娥清出栗園，奚斤等從西道，出爾寒山。諸軍至漠南，舍輜重，輕騎，齎十五日糧，度漠擊之。柔然部落大驚，絕迹北走。","content_fanyi":"十月二十一日癸卯，北魏主拓跋焘大举讨伐柔然，五道并进：司徒长孙翰等从东道出黑漠；廷尉卿长孙道生等出兵白漠、黑漠之间；魏主从中道亲率大军；东平公娥清出栗园；奚斤等从西道出尔寒山。诸军到达漠南，舍弃辎重，改作轻骑，携带十五日粮，越过大漠进击柔然。柔然各部落大惊，绝迹向北逃窜。","content_jianti_auto":"14癸卯，魏主大伐柔然，五道并进：长孙翰等从东道，出黑漠，廷尉卿长孙道生等出白、黑二漠之间，魏主从中道，东平公娥清出栗园，奚斤等从西道，出尔寒山。诸军至漠南，舍辎重，轻骑，赍十五日粮，度漠击之。柔然部落大惊，绝迹北走。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":10953,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二十 (宋紀二) / 太祖文皇帝上之上 / 二年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":2,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a6fc7772-db0e-11ef-8162-a0d3651f611f","year_int":425},"tongjian_id":"a6fc7772-db0e-11ef-8162-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"白","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"巢湖口","place_name_jianti_auto":"巢湖口","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9af83e0-db0e-11ef-9000-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白水","place_name_jianti_auto":"白水","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a9af83e1-db0e-11ef-b4c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"巢湖口及白水口也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"巢湖口及白水口也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a9af83df-db0e-11ef-85c5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白","place_name_jianti_auto":"白","resolved_place_entity_id":2940,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a9af83e4-db0e-11ef-9685-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十六、和州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：湖白口，巢湖、白水之口也。州南有白石水，合于栅江...","context_before":"湖白城[在州西南。","source_end_index":59,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"83d0ed50-e3a3-554b-b487-173d86da75f7","source_start_index":9,"source_text":"宋泰始二年，寻阳王子勋举兵江州，其将孙冲之屯于赭圻，为沈攸之所败，于湖白口筑二城，军主张兴世攻拔之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十六、和州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"孫沖之於湖、白口築二城，軍主竟陵張興世攻拔之。","content_fanyi":"东军孙冲之在巢湖口和白水口修筑了两座城池，军主竟陵人张兴世发起进攻，将二城攻克。","content_jianti_auto":"孙冲之于湖、白口筑二城，军主竟陵张兴世攻拔之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12242,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十一 (宋紀十三) / 太宗明皇帝上之下 / 泰始二年 / 第 34 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"a9af83de-db0e-11ef-8c64-a0d3651f611f","year_int":466},"tongjian_id":"a9af83de-db0e-11ef-8c64-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"白","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濃湖","place_name_jianti_auto":"浓湖","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9aff956-db0e-11ef-96d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鵲尾","place_name_jianti_auto":"鹊尾","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a9aff957-db0e-11ef-8324-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"濃湖在鵲尾下。先，悉薦翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"浓湖在鹊尾下。先，悉荐翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"a9aff955-db0e-11ef-be29-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白","place_name_jianti_auto":"白","resolved_place_entity_id":2940,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a9aff95c-db0e-11ef-b4a4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、太平府（卷二十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"沙洲移徙，姥山沦入江中矣。胡氏以为即巢湖中之姥山，似误。...","context_before":"...里。有三峰并秀。亦作姥山。或曰姥山，盖县西南江滨小山也。","source_end_index":85,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1c917bad-235d-5721-bb78-fd20de0bf96d","source_start_index":36,"source_text":"沈攸之破孙冲之于赭圻，追至姥山而还。又子勋将陶亮屯鹊洲，于姥山及诸冈分立营寨，及冲之败，亦各散还。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十一、太平府（卷二十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"陶亮聞湖、白二城不守，大懼，急召孫沖之還鵲尾，留薛常寶等守赭圻；先於姥山及諸岡分立營寨，亦各散還，共保濃湖。","content_fanyi":"陶亮得知巢湖口、白水口两城失守，大为恐惧，急忙下令孙冲之撤回鹊尾，留下薛常宝等人驻守赭圻；此前在姥山和各处山冈分设的营垒寨防，也各自解散撤回，共同保卫浓湖。","content_jianti_auto":"陶亮闻湖、白二城不守，大惧，急召孙冲之还鹊尾，留薛常宝等守赭圻；先于姥山及诸冈分立营寨，亦各散还，共保浓湖。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12244,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十一 (宋紀十三) / 太宗明皇帝上之下 / 泰始二年 / 第 36 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"a9aff954-db0e-11ef-bd95-a0d3651f611f","year_int":466},"tongjian_id":"a9aff954-db0e-11ef-bd95-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"白","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"揚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4179-db0e-11ef-be2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建康","place_name_jianti_auto":"建康","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a9bb417a-db0e-11ef-ab19-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"揚州，謂建康。","note_content_jianti_auto":"扬州，谓建康。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4178-db0e-11ef-9970-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"胡","people_name_jianti_auto":"胡","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a9bb417e-db0e-11ef-b988-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳慶","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈庆","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a9bb417f-db0e-11ef-8fbb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鵲頭","place_name_jianti_auto":"鹊头","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4180-db0e-11ef-abe4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"錢溪","place_name_jianti_auto":"钱溪","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4181-db0e-11ef-8587-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：宋略曰：「胡進軍鵲頭，遣其將陳慶以三百舸逼錢溪。」今從宋書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：宋略曰：「胡进军鹊头，遣其将陈庆以三百舸逼钱溪。」今从宋书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":181,"tongjian_id":"a9bb417d-db0e-11ef-a937-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言矢易盡。易，以豉翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言矢易尽。易，以豉翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":211,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4185-db0e-11ef-a88e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以牛皮冒艦以禦矢石，因謂之皮艦。艦，戶黯翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以牛皮冒舰以御矢石，因谓之皮舰。舰，户黯翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":329,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4186-db0e-11ef-b828-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"勒，約勒也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"勒，约勒也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":453,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4187-db0e-11ef-8cb4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白","place_name_jianti_auto":"白","resolved_place_entity_id":2940,"start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"a9bb620c-db0e-11ef-b7cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、太平府（卷二十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"今湖已湮废。《志》云：县西南二十余里有官庄湖，即荻港支流...","context_before":"浓湖[在县西南三十里。","source_end_index":82,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d298f909-e5a7-5847-9250-4d9e64e0ed64","source_start_index":11,"source_text":"宋泰始二年，沈攸之破赭圻，子勋将袁觊等军于鹊尾，与攸之相拒于浓湖，张兴世请帅奇兵潜出浓湖之上，夺其钱溪，攸之等因进攻浓湖，以缀觊等之兵，是也。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十一、太平府（卷二十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十二、池州府（卷二十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：梅根港有铸钱监，故亦曰钱溪。回洑者，旋流为回，伏...","context_before":"...里即梅根监，历代铸钱之所，有钱官司之，故梅根港亦曰钱溪。","source_end_index":335,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"94e530bf-543e-54c0-b493-30000175d968","source_start_index":124,"source_text":"宋泰始二年，晋安王子勋举兵江州，遣其将袁觊等与沈攸之相拒于浓湖，张兴世言于攸之曰：“钱溪江岸最狭，去大军不远，下临回洑，船下必来泊岸，又有横浦，可以藏舟，千人守险，万兵不能过也。若以奇兵数千，潜出其上，因险而壁，见利而动，使贼首尾周皇，进退疑阻，中流既梗，粮道自艰。制敌之奇，莫过于此。”攸之从之。兴世遂率轻舸过鹊尾，夕宿景洪浦，潜遣别将黄道标，帅七十舸径趣钱溪，立营寨，引兵进据之。刘胡自鹊尾来攻，船入回洑，为兴世所败。"},{"context_after":"梁承圣初，王僧辨讨侯景，遣侯瑱袭鹊头戍，克之。唐武德七年...","context_before":"...，会晋安王子勋举兵寻阳，不敢进，子勋长史邓琬遣兵劫迎之。","source_end_index":229,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b257b7ac-d2ea-5129-9c79-9b76d7c34967","source_start_index":159,"source_text":"泰始二年，子勋发兵东下，其将刘胡军于鹊洲，会张兴世营于钱溪，胡欲繇鹊头内路攻之，不果。既而袁觊以刘胡败遁，自鹊尾走至鹊头，与戍将薛伯珍皆走。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十二、池州府（卷二十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十六、和州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"是也。赭圻、钱溪诸处，见繁昌、铜陵二县]。","context_before":"...合于栅江。是矣。《读书记》：湖、白二城当在栅口，滨大江，","source_end_index":149,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"83d0ed50-e3a3-554b-b487-173d86da75f7","source_start_index":111,"source_text":"张兴世以钱溪冲要，请奇兵潜出浓湖之上，率轻舸直前度湖白，过鹊尾，夕宿景洪浦。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十六、和州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"興世帥其衆泝流稍上，尋復退歸，如是者累日。劉胡聞之，笑曰：「我尚不敢越彼下取揚州，張興世何物人，欲輕據我上！」不爲之備。一夕，四更，值便風，興世舉帆直前，渡湖、白，過鵲尾。胡旣覺，乃遣其將胡靈秀將兵於東岸，翼之而進。戊戌夕，興世宿景洪浦，靈秀亦留。興世潛遣其將黃道標帥七十舸徑趣錢溪，立營寨；己亥，興世引兵進據之，靈秀不能禁。庚子，劉胡自將水步二十六軍來攻錢溪。將士欲迎擊之，興世禁之曰：「賊來尚遠，氣盛而矢驟；驟旣易盡，盛亦易衰，不如待之。」令將士治城如故。俄而胡來轉近，船入洄洑；興世命壽寂之、任農夫帥壯士數百擊之，衆軍相繼並進，胡敗走，斬首數百，胡收兵而下。時興世城寨未固，建安王休仁慮袁顗幷力更攻錢溪，欲分其勢。辛丑，命沈攸之、吳喜等以皮艦進攻濃湖，斬獲千數。是日，劉胡帥步卒二萬、鐵馬一千，欲更攻興世，未至錢溪數十里，袁顗以濃湖之急，遽追之，錢溪城由此得立。胡遣人傳唱，「錢溪已平」，衆並懼，沈攸之曰：「不然。若錢溪實敗，萬人中應有一人逃亡得還者，必是彼戰失利，唱空聲以惑衆耳。」勒軍中不得妄動；錢溪捷報尋至。攸之以錢溪所送胡軍耳鼻示濃湖，袁顗駭懼。攸之日暮引歸。","content_fanyi":"张兴世率领部众逆流而上，不久又退回，一连多日都是如此。刘胡听说后，取笑道：“我尚且不敢越过他们的阵地去攻取扬州，张兴世是个什么人物，竟然想轻易占据我的上游！”因而不加防备。一天夜里四更时分，正逢顺风，张兴世扬帆向西直进，渡过湖口、白水口，再过了鹊尾。刘胡发觉之后，急忙派将领胡灵秀领兵在东岸追赶，紧随张兴世船队前进。七月十三日戊戌当晚，张兴世宿营景洪浦，胡灵秀也留驻下来。张兴世暗中派部将黄道标率领七十条快艇直趋钱溪，建立营寨；七月十四日己亥，张兴世率主力向西推进，直接进驻钱溪新营，胡灵秀无法阻挡。七月十五日庚子，刘胡亲自率领水陆联合的二十六军前来攻打钱溪。将士们想迎击敌人，张兴世制止说：“贼兵离得还远，气势虽盛，箭发如雨；箭发太急容易枯竭，气势太盛也容易衰落，不如等待。”他命令将士照旧修筑工事。不久，刘胡的船队逐渐靠近，驶入漩涡急流；张兴世命寿寂之、任农夫率领精壮军士数百人出击，各军相继跟进，刘胡战败退走，被斩首数百人，刘胡收兵退下。当时张兴世的城寨还未坚固，建安王刘休仁担心袁顗集中兵力再攻钱溪，想分散他的兵势。辛丑日，刘休仁命沈攸之、吴喜等用蒙皮战船进攻浓湖，斩获一千多人。当天，刘胡率步兵二万、铁骑一千，准备再攻张兴世；还未到达距钱溪几十里处，袁顗因浓湖危急，急忙将他追回，钱溪城因此得以巩固。刘胡派人到处传喊：“钱溪已经平定。”众人闻讯都很恐惧，沈攸之说：“不对。如果钱溪真的战败，上万士卒中总应有人逃回来；这一定是他们作战失利，故意喊出空话来迷惑众人。”他约束军中不得轻举妄动；不久，钱溪的捷报便送到了。沈攸之把从钱溪送来的刘胡军士兵耳鼻展示给浓湖守军看，袁顗惊骇恐惧。黄昏时分，沈攸之率军返回。","content_jianti_auto":"兴世帅其众溯流稍上，寻复退归，如是者累日。刘胡闻之，笑曰：「我尚不敢越彼下取扬州，张兴世何物人，欲轻据我上！」不为之备。一夕，四更，值便风，兴世举帆直前，渡湖、白，过鹊尾。胡既觉，乃遣其将胡灵秀将兵于东岸，翼之而进。戊戌夕，兴世宿景洪浦，灵秀亦留。兴世潜遣其将黄道标帅七十舸径趣钱溪，立营寨；己亥，兴世引兵进据之，灵秀不能禁。庚子，刘胡自将水步二十六军来攻钱溪。将士欲迎击之，兴世禁之曰：「贼来尚远，气盛而矢骤；骤既易尽，盛亦易衰，不如待之。」令将士治城如故。俄而胡来转近，船入洄洑；兴世命寿寂之、任农夫帅壮士数百击之，众军相继并进，胡败走，斩首数百，胡收兵而下。时兴世城寨未固，建安王休仁虑袁𫖮幷力更攻钱溪，欲分其势。辛丑，命沈攸之、吴喜等以皮舰进攻浓湖，斩获千数。是日，刘胡帅步卒二万、铁马一千，欲更攻兴世，未至钱溪数十里，袁𫖮以浓湖之急，遽追之，钱溪城由此得立。胡遣人传唱，「钱溪已平」，众并惧，沈攸之曰：「不然。若钱溪实败，万人中应有一人逃亡得还者，必是彼战失利，唱空声以惑众耳。」勒军中不得妄动；钱溪捷报寻至。攸之以钱溪所送胡军耳鼻示浓湖，袁𫖮骇惧。攸之日暮引归。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12276,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十一 (宋紀十三) / 太宗明皇帝上之下 / 泰始二年 / 第 68 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"a9bb4176-db0e-11ef-89b9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":466},"tongjian_id":"a9bb4176-db0e-11ef-89b9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"白","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"守，式又翻。帥，讀曰率。降，戶江翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"守，式又翻。帅，读曰率。降，户江翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b77a771e-db0e-11ef-be5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"檀道濟","people_name_jianti_auto":"檀道济","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"b77a7720-db0e-11ef-acbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":157,"tongjian_id":"b77a7721-db0e-11ef-934c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高州","place_name_jianti_auto":"高州","place_note":"治广东阳江","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b77a7722-db0e-11ef-a691-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高涼郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"高凉郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b77a7723-db0e-11ef-9470-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羅州","place_name_jianti_auto":"罗州","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b77a7724-db0e-11ef-a101-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石城郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"石城郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b77a7725-db0e-11ef-b7cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春州","place_name_jianti_auto":"春州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b77a7726-db0e-11ef-bdb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽春郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳春郡","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b77a7727-db0e-11ef-b6ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白州","place_name_jianti_auto":"白州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b77a7728-db0e-11ef-8e30-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南昌郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南昌郡","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b77a7729-db0e-11ef-9a59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崖州","place_name_jianti_auto":"崖州","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b77a772a-db0e-11ef-b4f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"珠崖郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"珠崖郡","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b77a772b-db0e-11ef-b383-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林州","place_name_jianti_auto":"林州","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b77a772c-db0e-11ef-a0c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桂林郡","plac